From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:40:37 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] feat(desktop): add v3 actions registry, useAction hook,
 and capabilities detection

Add typed per-area ActionDef registries for frame, onboarding, home,
projects, project, inbox, bench, and settings. Implement registry
validation with duplicate checking. Provide useAction hook routing errors
to the toast notification port. Add capability detection for daemon
and provider health states.
